   E'D0 to D8 in one screen: team, problem, containment, root causes, actions, prevention, closure\nIs / Is-not, 5-Why and fishbone tools for the root cause\nActions with owners and due dates, overdue list, printed 8D report', 15, true)
on conflict (code) do update set name = excluded.name, tagline = excluded.tagline, features = excluded.features, is_active = true;

